### These requests work with the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
### Click "Send Request" above any line that starts with @ or ### to run it.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List all employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees

### Search employees by name/designation/skill
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?search=Kafka

### Filter employees by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?status=ON_LEAVE

### Get a single employee by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1

### Create a new employee
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "designation": "Intern",
  "skills": ["JavaScript"]
}

### Update an employee
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ON_LEAVE"
}

### Delete an employee
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1

### Validation error example (missing required fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### 404 example (employee that doesn't exist)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/9999
